OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns raised five years before
OL,4,Alaw firm collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former employee of a law group raised
OL,7,Fconcerns about its handling of clients'
OL,8,Fmoney five years before its eventual
OL,9,Fcollapse.
OL,11,FSheffield-based PM Law Ltd closed
OL,12,Fsuddenly on 2 February, leaving
OL,13,Fhundreds of employees out of work and
OL,14,Fmany clients stranded mid-transaction.
OL,16,FAn independent review revealed concerns
OL,17,Fabout the group had been raised to the
OL,18,FSolicitors Regulation Authority (SRA)
OL,19,Fas early as 2021 and "obvious red
OL,20,Fflags" had been missed during an
OL,21,Finvestigation.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
