OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns raised five years before
OL,4,Alaw firm collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement published this week, the
OL,7,FSRA said it was committed to changing
OL,8,Fthe way it regulated firms, adding:
OL,9,F"Opportunities were missed to act
OL,10,Fsooner and we want to prevent that
OL,11,Fhappening again."
